# Build output
**/build/
**/dist/
*.spec

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Generated at runtime inside a DCS install, never committed
inbox.lua
config.lua

# Windows mark-of-the-web leftovers. These are NTFS alternate data streams that WSL
# surfaces as real files, and the ':' in the name is illegal on Windows - committing one
# makes actions/checkout fail with "invalid path" on the windows-latest runner, before
# any test can run. That is what broke the atcai-v1.8.0 release build.
*:Zone.Identifier
